- BIND (strict): a file targets leg L at pin H iff one of:
  (a) a declared target-pin field ∈ {artifact_sha256, reviewed_sha256, target_sha256, schema_sha256, pinned_sha256, artifact_hash, reviewed_hash} equals H (full 64 hex, case-insensitive; or the field names a path#H pair), OR
